      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Automating this sounds like bad idea. I'd rather not lose specific people, and I'd rather not have to go and manually make sure each week that my friends aren't being deleted. \n\nSimply just adding a sorting method for friends would be enough. \n\nSort by Active, Offline, and Offline for (X) time. \n\nX being user defined by a drop down.",
