      "value": "@{5a3c5fa04a8da67427803b3e|full_name}: Automating would infact be a horrible idea. But it would still make sense to be able to remove inactive friends on the website as this has caused a lot of headache with friends list's being over certain amounts causing people to not appear in my lists. If the sorting does fix that then by all means I would be fine with this!",
