      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5a3c5fa04a8da67427803b3e|full_name}: To restate what I have said in-case it was confusing. No i do not want this to be an automated feature, I do although want there to be some sort of way to select people who have been offline for a specified time in my friend's list and remove them that way. And before there is a wipe I would like to hand pick out people who I still want to keep.",
