  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2019-06-27T02:15:22.288Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "My friend's list is too big and nobody ever joins me. I want to be able to clear that out so that I don't have to have all this clutter. Please add a button in the website that allows for people to clear out your inactive friend's and also put up a list of those people who are about to be cleared out so that I can look through that and pick out the ones I wanna keep before it does the wipe.",
